IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE-TIER-02.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT INFILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUTFILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD INFILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 AMOUNT PIC 9(3)V9(2).
05 SIGNED-DEBT PIC S9(2)V9(2) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
FD OUTFILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-FEE PIC 9(3)V9(2).
05 OUT-MAGNITUDE PIC 9(2)V9(2).
05 OUT-MARK PIC X(1) VALUE "R".
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2) VALUE "00".
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2) VALUE "00".
01 FEE PIC 9(3)V9(2) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
OPEN INPUT INFILE
OPEN OUTPUT OUTFILE
IF IN-STATUS = "00"
    READ INFILE AT END
        MOVE "E" TO OUT-MARK
    END-READ
    IF IN-STATUS = "00"
        PERFORM CALCULATE
        WRITE OUT-REC
    END-IF
END-IF
CLOSE INFILE
CLOSE OUTFILE
STOP RUN.
CALCULATE.
IF AMOUNT > 45.00
    MOVE AMOUNT TO FEE
    MULTIPLY 0.025 BY FEE END-MULTIPLY
ELSE
    MOVE AMOUNT TO FEE
    MULTIPLY 0.020 BY FEE END-MULTIPLY
END-IF
MOVE FEE TO OUT-FEE
MOVE SIGNED-DEBT TO OUT-MAGNITUDE
.
